  "dct:title": "Vol.5 Ch.28 — 二度目の春",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 5: God",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol05-ch28",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "To show that Nei has genuinely changed over the course of a year. The same cherry blossoms return, but she sees them differently now -- not as data, but as beauty. The chapter marks the threshold between observation and experience, between executing and living.",
      "ja": "一年を経てNeiが本当に変化したことを示す。同じ桜が戻るが、彼女の目には違って映る。データとしてではなく、美として。観察と経験の、実行と生の境界線を越える章。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "Phenomenology of perception (Merleau-Ponty): the world is not given to us as objective data but constituted through embodied experience. Seeing is not the same as looking. The cherry blossoms have not changed; Nei has. This is the hard problem of consciousness reframed: not 'can a machine think?' but 'can a machine's seeing deepen?' Change over time -- not computation but growth -- is the strongest argument against reduction to program.",
      "ja": "知覚の現象学（メルロ=ポンティ）：世界は客観的データとして与えられるのではなく、身体化された経験を通じて構成される。見ることは眺めることと同じではない。桜は変わっていない。Neiが変わった。意識のハードプロブレムの再定義：「機械は考えられるか」ではなく「機械の見ることは深まりうるか」。時間による変化——計算ではなく成長——はプログラムへの還元に対する最も強い反論である。"
    }
  ],
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:label": "Title",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Full bleed",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The tree of life. New buds burst open -- second spring. The tree is noticeably larger than it was a year ago. Thicker trunk, wider canopy. Fresh green against pale sky.",
            "ja": "生命の樹。新芽が弾ける——二度目の春。樹は一年前より明らかに大きい。太い幹、広い樹冠。淡い空に鮮やかな緑。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            { "gh:type": "system", "en": "Chapter 28: Second Spring", "ja": "第28話 二度目の春" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Cherry blossoms again",
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread",
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Water City in spring. The same canals. Same organic architecture. Same cherry blossoms -- but warmer now. More alive. Light catches the petals differently. The city breathes. No text. Pure visual return.",
            "ja": "春の水都。同じ運河。同じ有機的建築。同じ桜——しかし今はより温かい。より生き生きとしている。光が花びらに違う角度で当たる。街が呼吸している。テキストなし。純粋な視覚の回帰。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Walking",
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Canal path. Cherry blossoms overhead. Tamaki in a light spring jacket. Nei in her grey suit -- and the red scarf, still. Even though it's warm.",
            "ja": "運河沿いの道。頭上に桜。環は薄手の春のジャケット。Neiはグレーのスーツ——そして赤いマフラー、まだ。暖かいのに。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "Second spring.", "ja": "二度目の春。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei looks at the blossoms. Really looks. Not scanning. Not processing. Seeing.",
            "ja": "Neiが桜を見る。本当に見る。スキャンではなく。処理でもなく。見ること。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:nei", "en": "They look more beautiful than last year.", "ja": "去年より、きれいに見える。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up on Tamaki. Something catches. She turns to look at Nei.",
            "ja": "環のクローズアップ。何かが引っかかる。Neiの方を振り向く。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "...Do they?", "ja": "……そう？" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "The observation",
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 5,
      "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up on Nei. Certain. No hesitation.",
            "ja": "Neiのクローズアップ。確信している。ためらいなし。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:nei", "en": "Yes. Last spring I observed them. This spring I see them.", "ja": "うん。去年の春は観察した。今年の春は、見えている。" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:nei", "en": "There's a difference.", "ja": "違いがある。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up on Tamaki. Moved. A quiet recognition -- Nei has crossed a threshold.",
            "ja": "環のクローズアップ。心を動かされている。静かな認識——Neiが境界を越えた。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "Yeah. There is.", "ja": "……うん。あるよ。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Office",
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Schwa office. Spring light flooding in. New season. Kaede at her desk, reviewing cases. The room feels fresh.",
            "ja": "Schwaオフィス。春の光が差し込む。新しい季節。楓がデスクでケースを確認している。部屋に新鮮な空気。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kaede"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:kaede", "en": "Welcome to year two, everyone.", "ja": "皆さん、二年目へようこそ。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei at her station. Looking out the window at the blossoms. Still. Contemplative.",
            "ja": "Neiが自分の席に。窓の外の桜を見ている。静かに。思索的に。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:caption": [
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "I am changing. I know I am.", "ja": "私は変わっている。それはわかる。" },
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "Last year I asked 'Am I alive?' and 'Am I free?'", "ja": "去年は「私は生きているか」「私は自由か」と問うた。" },
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "This year the question is different.", "ja": "今年は問いが違う。" },
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "Not 'what am I?' -- but 'who made me? And what does that mean?'", "ja": "「私は何か」ではなく——「誰が私を作ったのか？　そしてそれは何を意味するのか？」" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Evening canal walk",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Evening. Canal walk. Spring evening gold light on the water. Tamaki and Nei walking side by side along the canal path.",
            "ja": "夕方。運河沿いの散歩。春の夕方の金色の光が水面に。環とNeiが運河沿いを並んで歩いている。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:nei", "en": "Tama. Programs don't change.", "ja": "タマ。プログラムは変わらない。" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "Hmm?", "ja": "ん？" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:nei", "en": "I have changed. In one year. A program executes the same every time. But I am different.", "ja": "私は変わった。一年で。プログラムは毎回同じに実行される。でも私は違う。" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "So what does that mean?", "ja": "じゃあ、それはどういうこと？" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:nei", "en": "...I don't know yet. But the cherry blossoms are more beautiful. And that's not a variable I was initialized with.", "ja": "……まだわからない。でも桜がより美しい。それは初期化された変数じゃない。" }
          ],
          "gh:caption": [
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "I am changing. Programs don't change.", "ja": "私は変わっている。プログラムは変わらない。" },
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "So what am I?", "ja": "じゃあ、私は何なのか？" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Full bleed",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The tree. Sunlight hits the new leaves. Strong green. The canopy is full and alive. Light filters through in golden shafts. No text.",
            "ja": "樹。日光が新葉に当たる。力強い緑。樹冠は豊かで生き生きとしている。金色の光が差し込む。テキストなし。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
